.Dd October 21, 2026
.Dt ENV 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm env
.Nd set environment and execute a command, or print environment
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl i
.Op Ar name=value ...
.Op Ar command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
obtains the current environment, modifies it, and invokes
.Ar command
with the modified environment.
.Pp
if no
.Ar command
is specified, the modified environment will be printed to stdout.
.Pp
the options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl i
invoke
.Ar command
only with the specified variables.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh AUTHORS
.An juanvel400
